                </article>
                <article>
                    <strong>1</strong>
                    <span>统一开发模型</span>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="known-home-proof">
                <div>
                    <strong>统一 C# 开发</strong>
                    <span>前端、服务、插件和宿主围绕同一语言与模型组织</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>多端宿主复用</strong>
                    <span>Server、Wasm、WinForm、MAUI 共享核心能力</span>
